        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVMv5YoDQd85axURjbD7hS6n76LtNqVV2XWWKYLLRoC6Bf5AJc=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "I recently had my car detailed by Smtk Detailing and I couldn't be happier with the results. From start to finish, the experience was top-notch. The team was punctual, professional, and clearly passionate about what they do. They took their time and paid attention to every little detail—my car hasn't looked this good since the day I drove it off the lot!\n\nThe interior was spotless, every surface was cleaned and conditioned, and even hard-to-reach spots were perfectly done. The exterior shine was incredible. Their customer service was just as impressive—friendly, responsive, and very accommodating.\n\nIf you're looking for a detailing company that truly goes above and beyond, I highly recommend Smtk Detailing . Worth every penny!",
        "time": 1745409963,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
